---
title: Compose tmux lifecycle retirement
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> attached
  attached --> captured : Compose exits
  captured --> signalled : owned mux stop
  signalled --> commandsRetired : no live command members
  signalled --> retained : observation unknown
  signalled --> escalated : 5 s grace expires
  escalated --> commandsRetired : no live command members
  escalated --> retained : deadline or probe error
  commandsRetired --> wrappersRetired : no live wrapper members
  commandsRetired --> wrapperEscalated : 5 s grace expires
  wrapperEscalated --> wrappersRetired : no live wrapper members
  wrapperEscalated --> retained : deadline or probe error
  wrappersRetired --> retired : remove owned record
  retired --> [*]
  note right of retained
    INV unknown is retained
    Report unconfirmed retirement
    Keep dependent helpers
  end note
  note right of signalled
    Mux acknowledgement is not group exit
    FIFO EOF is not group absence
    TERM separately grouped descendants
    Revalidate member identity before TERM or KILL
    Zombie-only groups are retired
    After KILL allow 2 s to confirm retirement
  end note
  note right of captured
    Capture roots only with matching PID and birth
  end note
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  class attached live
  class signalled,escalated,commandsRetired,wrapperEscalated wait
  class wrappersRetired,retired ok
  class retained fail
